,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"12550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,82,70,60,73,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"12550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10004","armor":"WP1001805","helmet":"WP1020905","horse":"WP1000815"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴晋武将。出身贫寒，初为通江县吏，因能徒手搏猛兽，被陆抗提拔，随征西陵督步阐。任建平太守时，见西晋王濬造舰，奏请增兵被孙皓拒，遂以铁锁横江御敌，晋军攻吴时独守建平不下。吴亡降晋，历金城、敦煌、雁门太守及顺阳内史，以清正慑服骄纵的顺阳王司马畅。交州刺史陶璜死后，出任南中都督、交州刺史，平定九真戍兵叛乱，在任二十余年威德显著。遣子吾咨援宁州讨夷。后入朝为大长秋，卒于任内。","tc":"吳晉武將。出身貧寒，初為通江縣吏，因能徒手搏猛獸，被陸抗提拔，隨征西陵督步闡。任建平太守時，見西晉王濬造艦，奏請增兵被孫皓拒，遂以鐵鎖橫江御敵，晉軍攻吳時獨守建平不下。吳亡降晉，歷金城、敦煌、雁門太守及順陽內史，以清正懾服驕縱的順陽王司馬暢。交州刺史陶璜死后，出任南中都督、交州刺史，平定九真戍兵叛亂，在任二十余年威德顯著。遣子吾咨援寧州討夷。后入朝為大長秋，卒于任內。","en":"An Officer of Wu and Jin. Born into poverty, he initially served as a minor official in Tongjiang County. Promoted by Lu Kang for fighting fierce beasts with his bare hands, he joined the campaign against Bu Chan, the Area Commander of Xiling. As Governor of Jianping, seeing the Western Jin general Wang Jun building warships, he petitioned Sun Hao for reinforcements but was refused, he then spanned iron chains across the river to repel the enemy. When the Jin forces invaded Wu, he alone held Jianping without falling. After Wu's fall, he surrendered to Jin and served successively as Governor of Jincheng, Dunhuang, and Yanmen, and Senior Clerk of Shunyang, where his integrity overawed the arrogant Sima Chang, Prince of Shunyang. After Tao Huang, Inspector of Jiao Province, passed away, he was appointed Viceroy of Nanzhong and Inspector of Jiao Province, suppressing the mutiny of the Jiuzhen garrison troops. He governed with great prestige and virtue for over twenty years. He dispatched his son Wu Zi to assist Ningzhou in subjugating the barbarians. Later, he entered the imperial court as Chamberlain of the Palace and died in office.","jp":"呉・晋の武将。貧しい家柄の出身。初めは通江県の小吏を務めていたが、素手で猛獣と格闘できるほどの武勇を陸抗に見出されて抜擢され、陸抗に従い西陵督・歩闡の征討に従軍した。建平太守に任じられた際、西晋の王濬による艦船建造を見て増兵を上奏したが孫皓に退けられ、鉄鎖で長江を横断して敵に備え、晋軍が呉へ侵攻した際にも独り建平を守り抜き、陥落しなかった。呉の滅亡後は晋に降り、金城・敦煌・雁門の太守や順陽内史を歴任し、その清正さをもって驕縦な順陽王・司馬暢を畏服させた。交州刺史の陶璜が世を去ると南中都督・交州刺史に就任して九真の守備兵による反乱を平定し、在職二十余年にわたり威徳を大いに示した。子の吾諮を派遣して寧州を救援し、夷を討たせた。後に入朝して大長秋となり、在任中に没した。","kr":"오나라와 서진의 무장이다. 빈한한 집안 출신으로, 처음에는 통강현의 현리가 되었으나 맨손으로 맹수를 때려잡는 용력 덕분에 육항에게 발탁되어 서릉독 보천을 정벌하는 데 종군했다. 건평태수로 재임할 때 서진의 왕준이 전함을 건조하는 것을 보고 군사를 늘려줄 것을 청했으나 손호에게 거절당하자, 쇠사슬로 강을 가로질러 적을 막았으며 진나라 군대가 오나라를 침공했을 때도 홀로 건평을 지켜내 함락되지 않았다. 오나라가 멸망하자 진나라에 항복하여 금성·돈황·안문태수 및 순양내사를 두루 역임했고, 청렴하고 강직함으로 방자한 순양왕 사마창을 굴복시켰다. 교주자사 도황이 사망한 뒤 남중도독 겸 교주자사로 부임하여 구진 수병의 반란을 평정했으며, 재임 20여 년 동안 위엄과 덕망을 널리 떨쳤다. 아들 오자를 파견해 영주를 구원하고 이민족을 토벌하게 했다. 이후 조정에 들어가 대장추가 되었으며, 재임 중 세상을 떠났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1035115","remark":"统帅","surname":"吾","surnameTc":"吾","surnameEn":"Wu","surnameJp":"吾","surnameKr":"오","surnameOther":"","name":"彦","nameTc":"彥","nameEn":"Yan","nameJp":"彦","nameKr":"언","nameOther":"","word":"士则","wordTc":"士則","wordEn":"Shize","wordJp":"士則","wordKr":"사칙","wordOther":"","icon":"吾彦","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"245","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"82","wise":"70","politics":"60","charm":"73","will":"89","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"67/18/85/80/77/40/34/54","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1004805","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6600","battleSoulPoint":"7200","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"1003008","strategy2":"1000905;1004401;1001001","professions":"3/2/0/3/0/3/3/0/